# Database naming

Canon: [db/schema.sql](../../db/schema.sql). Locked by migration `000007_schema_naming_unification`.

## Tables

| Rule | Example |
| ---- | ------- |
| Schema | `mentorix` |
| Name | `snake_case`, **plural** | `programs`, `trainer_clients` |
| Domain prefix | `auth_*`, `user_*`, `trainer_*`, `program_*` |
| Child table | **immediate parent** prefix | `program_week_days`, `program_week_day_blocks` |
| PK | `id uuid` | |
| Link / junction | both roles in name | `trainer_clients` |

**Immediate-parent rule:** FK `program_week_day_block_id` → table `program_week_day_block_exercises`.

## Columns

| Kind | Pattern | Example |
| ---- | ------- | ------- |
| FK | `{role}_id` | `program_id`, `week_id`, `program_week_day_block_id` |
| Client link | `client_user_id` | not `client_id` |
| Trainer link | `trainer_id` → `trainers` | not `trainer_user_id` |
| Type | concrete name | `exercise_type`, `block_type` — not `type` |
| Enum values | `snake_case` + CHECK | `email_password`, `published` |
| Audit | `created_at`, `modified_at`, `created_by`, `modified_by` | |
| Soft delete | `deleted_at` | |

## Ordering fields

| Field | Scope | UNIQUE | Meaning |
| ----- | ----- | ------ | ------- |
| `sort_order` | siblings under same parent | no | UI/DnD position; app keeps `1..N` |
| `week_number` | per `program_id` | yes | stable label |
| `day_number` | per `week_id` | yes | stable label |
| `version_number` | per `program_id` | yes | frozen publish label |

`sort_order` is reused; scope = table + parent FK.

## Constraints

| Kind | Pattern |
| ---- | ------- |
| UNIQUE | `{table}_{cols}_uniq` |
| INDEX | `{table}_{col(s)}_idx` |
| CHECK enum | `{table}_{col}_check` |

## Program trees

```text
programs → program_weeks → program_week_days → program_week_day_blocks
  → program_week_day_block_exercises
program_versions → program_version_weeks → program_version_week_days
  → program_version_week_day_blocks → program_version_week_day_block_exercises
program_assignments
```

## Workflow

Migration → `db/queries/` → `sqlc generate` → `make schema-sync` → feature doc table rows only.

## Avoid (000007 renames)

`refresh_sessions`, `invites`, `link_codes`, `trainer_user_id`, `exercises.type`, `added_by`.
